      "text": "We have a new Studio! To celebrate, I put together a new episode style. In this launch episode, we explored:\n\n-The world\u2019s worst phone call of all time\n-If the act of self-improvement is problematic\n-Tom Cruise stops by the new set \n-And much more\u2026\n\n\ud83d\udd17 open.spotify.com/episode/6fg\u2026",
